     * or is null for none); the policy date, null when blank (the sheet's today), and the period numbering from, null
     * when blank (off); the entry date, null when blank (off); the grace days, null when blank (off); the pot, two decimals or null for none; the alert threshold, two decimals or null for off; the parent sheet's id, null for none; the fiscal start month, 1 to 12; and every value recorded for the dated settings, from which the screen works out the one in
